1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:57,950
The first Suzaku sacrificed himself

25
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:03,080
along with 9 Middle stage Ascendant cultivators

26
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:06,470
to make the 5 Sealing Swords

27
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:11,320
and seal the Forsaken Immortal Clan for tens of thousands of years.

28
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,830
But today,

29
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:16,470
this old man can rival peak Ascendant !

30
00:02:13,880 --> 00:02:17,000
Original Ancestor of the
Forsaken Immortal Clan
11-Leaf

31
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:20,710
No one can stop my clan from taking back planet Fu Wen !

32
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:29,710
Back then,

33
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:32,630
this old man was but a coward

34
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:37,120
who had to watch countless clan members die.

35
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:40,120
For tens of thousands of years,

36
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:43,510
they fed me the lives of my own brethren

37
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:46,670
because I was the Ancestor.

38
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:49,750
This old man is a sinner...

39
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:52,110
I deserve to die...

40
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:56,790
I will be sealed by these swords

41
00:02:57,560 --> 00:03:00,040
in place of the Forsaken Immortal Tree.

42
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,590
I offer my soul

43
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,790
as sacrifice.

44
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:07,870
In exchange,

45
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,840
the Forsaken Immortal Clan

46
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:12,390
will be free !

47
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,880
I will die for the Dao

48
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,470
so that my clan

49
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,670
may walk this earth again !

50
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:30,880
Ancestral Spirit Tree
Forsaken Immortal Clan

51
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,190
Forsaken Immortal Clan,

52
00:03:55,640 --> 00:03:57,390
bid farewell to the Ancestor.

53
00:03:58,040 --> 00:04:00,510
Farewell Ancestor.

54
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,880
Take back the planet !

55
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:03,910
Kill !

56
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,110
Kill !

57
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,270
Kill !

58
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,670
Kill !

59
00:04:11,600 --> 00:04:15,790
As the 14th generation Suzaku,

60
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:19,760
I command all countries of planet Suzaku

61
00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:21,830
to wage war against

62
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:24,680
the Forsaken Immortal Clan !

63
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:46,360
Even if I'm one step from Soul Transformation,

64
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:48,520
the amount of celestial jades I have

65
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:51,000
is far from enough to breakthrough.

66
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:53,160
Celestial jades are rare.

67
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:56,000
I must return to the Soul Refining Sect first

68
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:58,960
to seek Senior Du Tian’s guidance.

69
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:06,280
This is…

70
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:09,760
the Forsaken Immortal Clan ?

71
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:15,640
Country of Zhao

72
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,600
Wang Zhuo
Xuan Dao Sect Elder
Late stage Core Formation

73
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:32,040
Be careful !

74
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:41,440
Junior Brother !

75
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:43,760
You Forsaken Immortal bandits,

76
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:44,960
come out and face me !

77
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,120
That’s…

78
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:53,280
Pang Long
Forsaken Immortal Clan
6-Leaf Shaman

79
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,710
a 6-leaf Shaman !

80
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,870
Little brats

81
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,240
you can keep trying,

82
00:05:58,240 --> 00:06:00,030
I'm not done playing with you.

83
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:03,230
Since you refuse to surrender,

84
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:06,310
I will let my Juniors practice on you !

85
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,030
I’ll fight you to the death !

86
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,750
Boring.

87
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,590
Die !

88
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,230
Break.

89
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:04,640
Who’s there ?!

90
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:08,790
Soul Transformation !

91
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,270
Run !

92
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:11,920
Mosquito Beast !

93
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:35,960
When you reach Nascent Soul,

94
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:38,230
you will remember the past.

95
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:40,560
It’s you ?

96
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:43,800
The Senior that reached Soul Formation at Heng Yue...

97
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:45,480
A few years have passed

98
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:48,280
and you’re already at Late stage Core Formation.

99
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,070
Not bad.

100
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:54,120
Unfortunately, I haven't managed to form a Nascent Soul.

101
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,880
I’ll help you.

102
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:18,760
Wang Zhuo
Xuan Dao Sect Elder
Early stage Nascent Soul

103
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:25,410
Wang Lin...

104
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:27,510
Thank you.

105
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,400
We're the last remnants of the Wang Family,

106
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:32,640
you don't need to thank me.

107
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,480
Times have changed...

108
00:08:37,880 --> 00:08:40,680
We once took the Spirit Root test together.

109
00:08:40,920 --> 00:08:42,640
Who could’ve imagined

110
00:08:42,680 --> 00:08:45,160
that things would turn out like this ?

111
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,400
What happened

112
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:48,880
for planet Suzaku to be in this state ?

113
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:50,160
You don’t know !?

114
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,840
These past few years,

115
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,880
I haven’t been on planet Suzaku.

116
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:56,750
Wang Lin’s cultivation

117
00:08:57,880 --> 00:09:00,080
can now traverse the void...

118
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:03,990
3 years ago,

119
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:07,760
the Forsaken Immortal Clan declared war against Suzaku.

120
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:10,470
The country of Suzaku called all countries for help in the war.

121
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,720
But who would've thought

122
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:15,000
that the Forsaken Immortal Clan plotted for millennia.

123
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:17,200
They had sent 9 cultivators to the surface

124
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:19,520
to infiltrate important countries.

125
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:22,320
Now, these 9 all hold key positions.

126
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,400
Only 5 of them have been exposed.

127
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,160
But with their help from within,

128
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:28,590
the country of Suzaku was forced to retreat.

129
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,280
To try to turn the tide,

130
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:34,160
Qian Feng challenged the Forsaken Immortal Clan's young patriarch alone.

131
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,840
After 3 days and 3 nights,

132
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:37,030
Their duel

133
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:38,550
ended in a draw.

134
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:41,320
After the stalemate,

135
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:44,920
the Forsaken Immortal Clan agreed to a truce.

136
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:48,040
But no one expected

137
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:50,350
that the condition for this truce

138
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:53,830
was for Suzaku to cede all countries under rank 4

139
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:57,390
and hand over their cultivators and gifted children.

140
00:09:59,040 --> 00:09:59,990
Since then

141
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:03,430
all rank 3 countries have been in this state.

142
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:06,040
Some were forced to surrender

143
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:07,880
and others refused to yield,

144
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:10,120
becoming a living hell.

145
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:13,630
Our Country of Zhao is struggling to hold on.

146
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,780
We're at our wit's end.

147
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,640
The mission of our squad

148
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:19,430
was to get help from a rank 4 country

149
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:22,310
in hope that someone will accept to shelter us.

150
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,200
But...

151
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:27,000
not only did they coldly refuse

152
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:29,640
but they even mocked us for resisting.

153
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:32,040
And problems never come alone,

154
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:35,400
we were ambushed by the Forsaken Immortal Clan on our way back.

155
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:37,280
I fear it won't be long

156
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:38,960
before Zhao falls too.

157
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:40,710
Wang Lin,

158
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:43,720
can you return to Zhao ?

159
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:52,840
Master,

160
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:55,440
if this Senior is so powerful,

161
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:57,960
couldn't he resolve our country's crisis ?

162
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,600
If he helps us,

163
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,680
he'd make enemies of both sides.

164
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:05,830
In these times,

165
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:09,070
no one wants be in this kind of situation.

166
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,150
Your Highness

167
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:24,120
Wang Qi
Prince of Zhao

168
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:24,120
Queen consort of Zhao

169
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:22,560
3 children in the capital

170
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:24,670
were already taken by the outsiders.

171
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:26,320
Wang Yu
Crown prince of Zhao

172
00:11:25,400 --> 00:11:28,110
Are you sure that place can protect Yu'er ?

173
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:29,990
I'm not sure.

174
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:32,160
But my great-grandfather told me

175
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:34,110
the family's oldest rule:

176
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:36,560
When facing annihilation,

177
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:38,560
enter the Ancestral Home

178
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:40,160
and your life will be saved.

179
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:42,870
What's so special about that Ancestral Home ?

180
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:46,080
Before our Wang Family came to the capital,

181
00:11:46,520 --> 00:11:49,120
one of us became a powerful Immortal.

182
00:11:49,560 --> 00:11:50,830
He's known as the Ancestor.

183
00:11:51,800 --> 00:11:52,920
The Ancestral Home

184
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:55,320
must contain something he left.

185
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:57,160
But after all these years,

186
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:58,800
I'm not sure if it's true.

187
00:12:00,040 --> 00:12:02,630
Where have all the Immortals from the capital gone ?

188
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:05,310
They could've protected us !

189
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:08,870
They returned to their sects to fight.

190
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:09,990
If defeated,

191
00:12:10,800 --> 00:12:12,270
they'll gather at a designated place.

192
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,720
The Sect Formation is falling !
